        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Fortune's Favor"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(curse, divine, incapacitation, polymorph)\n\nFrequency: 1/day\n\nA target creature within 30 feet must succeed at a 25 Will save or gain the effects of cursed metamorphosis, being polymorphed into a pig whose girth is determined by the target's wealth. After 24 hours, the target can end this effect using a Dismiss action, at which point the yeongno becomes aware that the effect has ended. A yeongno can use Fortune's Favor only if no targets are currently under its effects."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "three_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
